  "description": "The radius-1.5-cm circumference with center O, boundary point A, radius OA, and exterior point M. Modern regularization, not extra source givens: circularize the scan and regularize unmeasured angles and exterior spacing. Display no added distance, coordinate, radius label, fill or membership answer.",
  "source": {
