    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo68-c1-s1",
        "text": "我们来看看半径为$1.5\\mathrm{cm}$的圆周（图2）．它是由平面上和中心$O$的距离等于$1.5\\mathrm{cm}$的所有的点组成的．例如，$|AO|$ $=1.5\\mathrm{cm}$（这种记号读作：距离$|AO|$等于$1.5$厘米）．如果点$M$不属于这个圆周，那么$|MO|\\ne1.5\\mathrm{cm}$．"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo68-c1-s1",
        "text": "定义 在同一平面上，和已知点的距离为已知正数的点的集合，叫做圆周．"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo68-c1-s1",
        "text": "圆心为$O$、半径为$r$的圆周记作：圆周$(O,r)$．"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-circumference-O-A-M",
        "description": "Single unfilled circumference; exactly three marked points and Latin labels O, A, M. O is the center, A is on the upper-right boundary, and M is outside to the right and slightly above O. One solid OA radius, without a printed label. No subfigures, axes, grid, ticks or arrows. Inventory recorded in source-inventory.md before spec construction.",
        "objects": ["circle", "O", "A", "M", "radius-OA"],
        "assertions": ["A-on-circle", "radius-is-1p5", "M-outside-distance", "radius-connects-O-A", "three-source-points"],
        "requires": ["pointRelationships"]
      }
    ]
  },
